---
// About — who I am, and the role I'm looking for (the one inverted row)
---
<section id="about" class="poster" aria-label="About Marco Fornari">
  <div class="band"><p class="band-label" data-i18n="about.kicker">01 / ABOUT</p></div>
  <div class="sheet">
    <div class="intro">
      <h2 class="name">Marco<br>Fornari</h2>
      <p class="lede" data-i18n="about.lede">I build software<br>and study how to defend networks and systems.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rows">
      <div class="row">
        <h3 data-i18n="about.profile">Profile</h3>
        <div class="prose">
          <p data-i18n="about.p1">Hi, I'm Marco: a <strong>junior developer</strong> with a passion for networks, systems and cybersecurity.</p>
          <p data-i18n="about.p2">I graduated from ITS in Industrial Software Development with 110/110 cum laude. In 2026 I built Overguard, an anti-phishing platform for small businesses: the first project where I brought development and security together.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- the selected departure: what I'm looking for, inverted and set large -->
      <div class="row seek">
        <h3 data-i18n="about.goal">Looking for</h3>
        <div class="seek-body">
          <p class="seek-roles" data-i18n="about.goalRoles"><span>Network &amp; systems administrator</span><span class="seek-or">or</span><span>Cybersecurity analyst</span></p>
          <p class="seek-text" data-i18n="about.goalText">Today I'm a developer and I want to grow in this direction, in a team where my development background helps and I can learn on the job. Meanwhile, I'm preparing for the CEH certification.</p>
          <a class="seek-cta" href="#contact"><span data-i18n="about.goalCta">Let's talk</span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h15m0 0l-6-6m6 6l-6 6"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
